0df6df795018.plain:
In your Command phase, this WARLORD gives one of your units Light Cover against ranged attacks, and INFANTRY in terrain add a further 1 to armour saves. That unit must be one of your <FORGE WORLD> SKITARII CORE units within 9" of this WARLORD, or one of your <FORGE WORLD> CORE DATA TETHER units anywhere on the battlefield. Until your next Command phase starts, whenever a ranged attack is allocated to one of that unit's models:
- that model gets the benefits of Light Cover against the attack;
- if that model has the INFANTRY keyword and is entirely on or within a terrain feature, add a further 1 to any armour saving throw made against the attack.

25acd065b88e.plain:
In your Command phase, this WARLORD lets one of your units ignore hit penalties for firing Heavy weapons after moving or Assault weapons after Advancing. That unit must be one of your <FORGE WORLD> SKITARII CORE units within 9" of this WARLORD, or one of your <FORGE WORLD> CORE DATA TETHER units anywhere on the battlefield. Until your next Command phase starts, its models don't take the hit roll penalty for firing:
- Heavy weapons in a turn in which their unit moved;
- Assault weapons in a turn in which their unit Advanced.

45a741d28079.plain:
In your opponent's Charge phase, one of your GRAIA CORE units within 9" of this WARLORD can Heroically Intervene like a CHARACTER unit, up to 6". Pick that unit at the start of the Heroic Intervention step. Until the end of the phase:
- if any enemy unit is within 6" horizontally and 5" vertically of it, it can perform Heroic Interventions just as a CHARACTER unit could;
- each time one of its models makes a Heroic Intervention move, that model can move up to 6".

da61e883f618.plain:
While this WARLORD is on the battlefield, four Stratagems can each cost one fewer CP once per battle, if the right Imperative is active for your army. Each discount lasts until the end of the phase the Stratagem is used in, and can't take its cost below 0 CP:
- with the Protector Imperative active, the Binharic Offense Stratagem;
- with the Conqueror Imperative active, the Aggressive Override Stratagem;
- with the Bulwark Imperative active, the Bionic Endurance Stratagem;
- with the Aggressor Imperative active, the Expedited Purge Protocols Stratagem.
